d weapons lines are printed the same as the Knight''s and are stored the same way: handcuffs or manacles map to handcuffs-regular, matches and a lighter map to disposable-lighter-or-box-of-200-matches, metal spikes to spike, the sword and/or vibro-blade to vibro-sword. Not stored as rows: the sidearm and energy rifle (no type given), the armor (an open 60-100 M.D.C. range) and the mount or vehicle; all are in GM Notes. || CYBERNETICS: the two free cybernetic implants at first level are not stored, because the choice is unrestricted; carried in restrictions and GM Notes, as the NGR classes carry theirs. || BACKGROUND: the Optional Background Table for Knights (printed 104) is a d100 roll with no mechanics; it is carried in the Knight''s GM Notes and not repeated here, since the Royal Knight requires noble heritage."
